       "title": "Alert rule",
       "text": "A rule = **query** + **condition** + **pending period** (`for`). The pending period stops one bad scrape from waking someone up."
      },
      {
       "type": "form",
       "id": "alert",
       "title": "New alert rule",
       "fields": [
        {
         "id": "name",
         "label": "Rule name",
         "kind": "text",
         "options": [],
         "value": ""
        },
        {
         "id": "query",
         "label": "Query (PromQL)",
         "kind": "textarea",
         "options": [],
         "value": ""
        },
        {
         "id": "op",
         "label": "Condition",
         "kind": "select",
         "options": [
